cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Exact-BMF-Solver: an exact branch and bound for Boolean matrix factorization"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Drogo
    given-names: Flavio
    email: Flavio.Drogo@student.umons.ac.be
    affiliation: "Université de Mons"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-04
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Boolean matrix factorization
  - branch and bound
  - certified optimality
  - matrix completion
abstract: >-
  An exact solver for Boolean matrix factorization: starting from a given
  factorization, a combinatorial branch and bound on column patterns returns
  a certified interval and proves optimality when the two bounds meet. The
  best known factorizations of the benchmark are included as starting
  points. Rust, no external dependency. The scripts that rerun every
  measurement are included.
